motions.quote:
Moved by Mayor Shannon, seconded by Cr Everett

That Council:-

1. REQUESTS the CEO to prepare a letter for the CEO and Mayor to send to the Premier expressing the Town's support for the immediate implementation of the revaluation of Gross Rental Values and the Unimproved Value of properties by Landgate in 2020, and seeking the addition of the "Rate in the Dollar" information for all councils to the My Council website. The letter should also be copied to the Minister for Local Government and published on the Town's website under Public Notices on or before 5 May 2020;

Moved by Mayor Mack, seconded by Cr Le Page

That Council:

1. REVOKES Policy 33: Developer Contact with Staff Policy, as contained in Attachment 1;
